      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个ー，所以说……怎么办呢？\n用风水以外的办法解决，该怎么办好呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "998050e8a9abf5a26604bf18647c8881d59dba17dd2398e2c9506f0c732bc5d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098006.json",
      "json_path": [
