      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "诶？　心情……？　那个，应该就是，听到那个女孩子的悲鸣声时，\n感觉胸口很痛、大脑空白……",
      "source_fingerprint": "58c54f250d77cb3d52eed1779c2edb779a499058c0d90d3cc4d4a7213e0ea8ef",
