      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看向我的小林历奇，不知不觉间又恢复到了\n跟往常一样的开朗柔和的表情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f675a2900c61a89b8ccf0610c5732c151382b5ba78ba4d680575f199c141f25",
